# GUIDE.me — what's built, and how to start

Written for: anyone picking this repo up, including future you.

Warivo OS is an open head unit for ordinary electric scooters. An ESP32-C6 on the scooter
measures the things the scooter won't tell you, and a locked-down Android phone displays
them. Built by [enjoys.in](https://enjoys.in), maintainer Mulayam Singh.

This file is the status board and the runbook. [README.md](README.md) is the pitch and the
compatibility matrix; [docs/PROJECT_GUIDE.md](docs/PROJECT_GUIDE.md) is the architecture.

---

